        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://townofwarren-ri.gov/explore/historic_warren.php",
      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Historic Warren Armory, downtown, preserves a building tied to the town’s military past.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        15,
        16
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://townofwarren-ri.gov/explore/historic_warren.php",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Every May, Warren hosts the Warren Walkabout, a week‑long street festival featuring art, music, and local food.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        21,
        22
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
